COMMERCIAL USE

**Self-Deployment (FREE for commercial use):**

You may freely use this software for commercial purposes if you self-deploy it,
including:

- Internal tools within your company
- Code review for your own projects
- Running on your own infrastructure
- No revenue sharing required for self-hosted use

**Hosted/SaaS Use (10% Revenue Sharing Required):**

If you offer this software as a service to others, a Revenue Sharing License
is required:

- 10% of gross revenue from the hosted service/SaaS product
- Applies when you charge customers to use the code review functionality
- Requires written agreement with repository owner
- Includes ongoing support and updates
- Quarterly reporting and payments

**What requires a Revenue Sharing License:**

- Offering code review as a paid service to customers
- SaaS products that provide access to this functionality
- Selling hosted access to this software
- Any service where customers pay to use this code review capability

**What is FREE (no license required):**

- Self-deployed internal tools for your company
- Personal projects
- Educational and research purposes
- Non-profit organizations
- Evaluation and testing

For commercial licensing inquiries, please contact:

- GitHub: @yongchenglow
- Create an issue at: <https://github.com/yongchenglow/af-code-agent/issues>

